Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chips are built through repeated deposition, patterning, etching, and polishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.01,0:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Metrology checks the result, helping engineers keep the next run on target.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But measurements arrive late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After a process shift, wafers keep moving while models are still learning from older results.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,REFLEX targets that feedback gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We combine a baseline, a drift filter, and a regime model.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Each request retains its timestamp and original prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Expert weights update only when the matching measurement arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is actual local inference on a public recorded stream, accelerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Both models request every fifth sample and receive results five samples later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The ensemble updates causally, with no future labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.81,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Its regime state is bounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,On dataset one, large prediction errors fell eighteen point eight percent at the same measurement budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is prediction quality, not measured defect reduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Across four delayed conditions, average root mean square error improved one percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Halving measurements did not pass overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A basic diode simulation extends the loop to design: ninety-seven percent less target mismatch than\Nrandom search.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our vision: learn from every experiment to design better semiconductor devices.
